MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_001: Don't worry. You've got this. You see? Now get your\nhead back on straight and get back out there!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_002: And stop listening to those fools. You're not the one\nwho's wrong! Ugh. I swear... Oh, did you hear that?
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_003: She had a baby not too long ago... And she's worried\nabout it. Of course she is.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_004: With how things are, should she have had a kid?\nTimes like these... Well, they make people worry.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_005: Doesn't help that people love to talk. "I feel bad for\nthe kid," "Can't fight with a baby!" Tch...
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_006: Sticking their stupid noses where they're not needed!\nI laid 'em out where they stood.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_007: <NCA>"Well done!"
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_008: <NCB>"Rein it in."
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_009: <ACA>Thing is, they already know they shouldn't be\nmouthing off.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_010: <ACA>But they went and did it anyway. It's plain as day—\nthey're anxious.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_011: <ACB>Hah! They're all veterans. They knew what they\nwere getting into and can take a few knocks!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_012: <ACB>But no matter how many battles they've survived,\nthey're still anxious. So they let off some steam.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_013: <NCA>"Anxious?"
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_014: It's war. Anyone could die. And there's no guarantee\nwe'll win.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_015: So they lash out, because it soothes their\nuncertainties. For a minute or two, anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_016: I asked them, "How can you hope to save the world if\nyou can't keep one baby safe?"
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_017: Ahh.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_018: Impressed with how I'm holding up? You're wrong.\nI'm at the end of my rope too.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_019: But if I can't keep it together, the people I care about\nwill suffer. And I can't bear to let a kid cry.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_020: That's how I put on a brave face. It's the mom in me.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_021: If I'm defeated, or just run off...somebody else is\ngonna get hurt. So I turn anxiety into strength.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_022: My girl might not be with us, but the mother's heart\nI got from her still beats just as strong as ever.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_A_023: You know what I mean, don't you, Promised One?\nWe're building a world where kids can smile again.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_001: Promised One! When did you get back?
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_002: Now stay where you are... Hyah!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_003: Oomph...
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_004: Not many people could block that. Yup, it's you!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_005: <NCA>"So you kicked me hello?"
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_006: <NCB>"You told me to stay still."
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_007: <ACA>After how you left, I didn't expect you to just show\nup like this!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_008: <ACB>That's not the issue. I put a lot of power into\nthat kick!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_009: It just doesn't make any sense. First you fight for all\nof us, and then you leave us all worrying about you.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_010: <NCA>"Doesn't anxiety turn into strength?"
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_011: Hey! You're the Promised One, not the\nPompous One!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_012: Though, honestly, if you can block that kick, then I\nknow you're fine. That's a relief.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_013: <NCA>"I am, and I'm glad you are too."
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_014: Of course. Mikaela Redblade isn't going to just keel\nover and give up the ghost.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_015: Make no mistake, it was a team effort. Even the ones\nI clubbed for their big mouths—them too.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_016: Remember that? The new mother? Everyone stood\ntall to protect her.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_017: So, now that you're back...what's next?
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_018: Hmm...
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_019: I see. You're going to keep on fighting, Promised\nOne. Well, that makes it easy.
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_020: <RSDS>I'll join you in that fight. For the sake of the world!
MID_SE_Ism_Mic_S_021: We have to do it for all the kids who are alive today,\ndon't we? No, don't answer—I know.